1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
01  |  WELCOME TO SLOTBOOK
A salon booking walkthrough with demo accounts. Passwords stay masked throughout.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
02  |  SERVICES & STYLISTS
Four treatments with transparent prices. Meet Meera and Karan and see their schedules.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
03  |  SIGN IN BEFORE BOOKING
Guests are redirected to login. Their selected treatment is remembered.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
04  |  CREATE A CUSTOMER ACCOUNT
Sign up with a name, a 10-digit phone number and a password.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
05  |  ACCOUNT CREATED
Successful signup returns to the booking page with the customer name and account phone prefilled.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:33,000
06  |  NO DUPLICATE PHONE ACCOUNTS
An existing phone number cannot create a second account.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,000
07  |  CUSTOMER SIGN IN
The phone number and password are checked before the customer can book.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
08  |  SELECT YOUR TREATMENT
Service duration and price update immediately as you choose Haircut, Hair spa, Beard trim or Facial.

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000
09  |  WEEKLY DAYS OFF
Meera is off on Sundays. The app shows no available slots on her day off.

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
10  |  NO PAST-DATE BOOKINGS
Past dates are blocked. The server also rejects times that have already passed today.

11
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
11  |  LIVE AVAILABILITY
Start times use 15-minute steps and account for full service duration, breaks and existing bookings.

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
12  |  CUSTOMER DETAILS ARE VALIDATED
Invalid names are rejected before an appointment is saved.

13
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
13  |  ACCOUNT PHONE OR ANOTHER NUMBER
Choose the account number, or enter another contact number. Exactly 10 digits are required.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
14  |  BOOKING CONFIRMED
The confirmation shows the booking ID, service, stylist, time, price and chosen contact number.

15
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
15  |  SAVED IN SQLITE
Refresh the private confirmation link: the saved appointment and contact number remain available.

16
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
16  |  RESCHEDULE WITHOUT CANCELLING
Open the saved appointment to choose a new treatment, stylist, date or time.

17
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:43,000
17  |  SAME BOOKING ID, UPDATED APPOINTMENT
The booking is now a 14:00 Facial for 900 rupees. Its ID and contact number are unchanged.

18
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:50,000
18  |  NO OVERLAPPING APPOINTMENTS
Booked slots, breaks and the 10-minute cleanup buffer are excluded from new bookings.

19
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
19  |  ANY STYLIST
Combined availability finds an eligible stylist automatically, including during another stylist’s break.

20
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
20  |  CUSTOMERS CANNOT OPEN THE ADMIN DASHBOARD
A customer visiting the admin area is sent to the separate admin sign-in page.

21
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,000
21  |  ADMIN ID + PHONE + PASSWORD
Each admin uses an owner-assigned special login ID together with their phone number and password.

22
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:15,000
22  |  A PRIVATE ADMIN DASHBOARD
Successful admin sign-in opens the dashboard with admin-only navigation and an eight-hour session.

23
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:22,000
23  |  DAILY BOOKINGS & REVENUE
Choose a day to view appointments grouped by stylist and total confirmed booking revenue.

24
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:29,000
24  |  ADMIN CANCELLATION
Cancel an appointment: the booking count and confirmed revenue update immediately.

25
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:35,000
25  |  SIGN-OUT REVOKES ADMIN ACCESS
Signing out ends the admin session and returns to admin sign-in.

26
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:41,000
26  |  RETURN AS A CUSTOMER
Customer and admin accounts have separate sessions and separate access permissions.

27
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:48,000
27  |  CANCELLED TIMES ARE AVAILABLE AGAIN
The cancelled 14:00 Facial slot is available again for Meera on the same day.

28
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:54,000
28  |  RESPONSIVE ON MOBILE
The same booking form adapts to smaller screens, with readable controls and phone-number choices.

29
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:00,000
29  |  SLOTBOOK: ALL FEATURES, ONE APP
Accounts, booking rules, rescheduling and private admin controls. The full suite passes 77 tests.
